OL,3,CMorning after Stoke-on-Trent fires
OL,4,Cshow devastating scale of damage
OL,6,FThe morning after the fires that
OL,7,Fravaged four homes in Stoke-on-Trent
OL,8,Fshows the scale of the devastating
OL,9,Fdamage it had on its residents.
OL,11,FThe fire began in Goldenhill area in
OL,12,Fthe fields behind homes and took hold
OL,13,Fwithin minutes, turning them to ash.
OL,15,FSix firefighters who battled to
OL,16,Fcontain the blaze were taken to
OL,17,Fhospital.
OL,19,FNazakat Ali is one of the residents
OL,20,Fwho was caught in the fire.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786731513
OL,3,CMorning after Stoke-on-Trent fires
OL,4,Cshow devastating scale of damage
OL,6,FHe told ITV News Central: "We were
OL,7,Fliterally inside and it was pitch
OL,8,Fblack and as soon as we came out,
OL,9,Fthere's was fire. Within ten minutes
OL,10,Fit caught up with all these houses."
OL,12,F"I'm heartbroken"
OL,14,FAnother resident, Samaire Tha said:
OL,15,F"I'm heartbroken, for people we know,
OL,16,Fpeople we see everyday who have had
OL,17,Ftheir lives turned around in split
OL,18,Fseconds."
OL,20,FMarie Lees was at home when it
OL,21,Fhappened.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786731513
OL,3,CMorning after Stoke-on-Trent fires
OL,4,Cshow devastating scale of damage
OL,6,F"Smoke was so acrid and thick and
OL,7,Fblack. So through the kitchen window I
OL,8,Fcould see a small fire at the back on
OL,9,Fthe bank.
OL,11,F"Literally as I'm standing there, a
OL,12,Fgust of wind came and it just caught
OL,13,Fthe trees, the leaves were on fire,
OL,14,Fthe fence went up.
OL,16,F"The wind blew and spread the fire
OL,17,Facross the fencing in the click of a
OL,18,Ffinger."
OL,20,FShe has been allowed to stay in her
OL,21,Fhome. Others haven't been so lucky.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786731513
OL,3,CMorning after Stoke-on-Trent fires
OL,4,Cshow devastating scale of damage
OL,6,FTracey Talbot was at work when she got
OL,7,Fthe call from her mother.
OL,9,FShe told ITV Central: "She rang me and
OL,10,Fshe said the garden is on fire, the
OL,11,Fsheds have gone, I've got to get out
OL,12,Fof the house.
OL,14,F"Luckily she went across the road to a
OL,15,Fneighbours house and took all the dogs
OL,16,Fover."
OL,18,FShe's says all she has is her work
OL,19,Fclothes and is still waiting to find
OL,20,Fout if, and when, she'll be allowed
OL,21,Fback in.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786731513
OL,3,CMorning after Stoke-on-Trent fires
OL,4,Cshow devastating scale of damage
OL,6,FIn the meantime, she's been waiting at
OL,7,Fthe nearby social club, where
OL,8,Fdonations from the community to help
OL,9,Fthose affected have been overwhelming.
OL,11,F"The generosity is amazing"
OL,13,FKelly-Anne Milner is a volunteer
OL,14,Fappealing for clothes and food to help
OL,15,Fpeople who have no possessions left.
OL,17,FShe said: "The generosity is amazing.
OL,18,FWe dropped off this morning and to see
OL,19,Fthe room of donations, it was out of
OL,20,Fthis world. Considering that was just
OL,21,Fa few hours."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786731513
OL,3,CMorning after Stoke-on-Trent fires
OL,4,Cshow devastating scale of damage
OL,6,FBack at the scene, firefighters
OL,7,Fcontinued to tackle the smouldering
OL,8,Fwreckage of the homes throughout the
OL,9,Fday.
OL,11,FCllr Chandra Kanneganti, for Sandyford
OL,12,Fand Goldenhill ward from the Stoke-on-
OL,13,FTrent City Council, praised the
OL,14,Fbravery and tenacity of the fire
OL,15,Fservices.
OL,17,F"Kudos to them, they've been working
OL,18,Fall night since yesterday evening. The
OL,19,Fpositive thing is that nobody is
OL,20,Fharmed.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786731513
OL,3,CMorning after Stoke-on-Trent fires
OL,4,Cshow devastating scale of damage
OL,6,F"But still someone has lost their
OL,7,Fhouse, which is a lifetime thing and
OL,8,Fwe are supporting them.
OL,10,FTwo people have been arrested on
OL,11,Fsuspicion of arson after a grass fire
OL,12,Fin the Goldenhill area spread quickly
OL,13,Fdamaging four homes.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/7
